&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop non-production environment build plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Updated the following tasks:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Select environment project tools
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Manage and monitor environments
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Archive and migrate data records
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Decommission or dispose of hardware
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Define non-production environment backup approach
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - This represents our first release of the Environment Management Method. It draws
    inspiration the Oracle Unified Method. It will serve as a basis for future improvements by our practitioner community.
